    "Protected Global Security maps to the canonical admin role and cannot be delegated by an ordinary PIM administrator",
    "Immutable group and PIM lifecycle history includes actor, target, reason, timestamps and planned lease expiry; disabling bootstrapped definitions retains the actual disabling actor",
    "Disabling a task group revokes live linked eligibilities and role leases, and makes previously issued role tokens stale",
    "Hard duration ceiling is ten hours; effective duration retains existing stricter role, group and eligibility limits",
    "Existing standing administrator rights are explicitly labelled and are not automatically removed"
